# The public half of tacctl's release key (docs/releasing.md): the bootstrap
# shim installs a release binary only when SHA256SUMS.sig verifies with a key
# listed here. One line per key:
#   tacctl-release namespaces="tacctl-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
# NO RELEASE KEY CONFIGURED YET: with no key line, every install and upgrade
# builds tacctl from source ("no release key configured").
